  70:../../opus/celt/quant_bands.c **** /*Parameters of the Laplace-like probability models used for the coarse energy.
  71:../../opus/celt/quant_bands.c ****   There is one pair of parameters for each frame size, prediction type
  72:../../opus/celt/quant_bands.c ****    (inter/intra), and band number.
  73:../../opus/celt/quant_bands.c ****   The first number of each pair is the probability of 0, and the second is the
  74:../../opus/celt/quant_bands.c ****    decay rate, both in Q8 precision.*/
